    <node id="&quot;CRY, THE BELOVED COUNTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"BOOK"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Cry, the Beloved Country is a novel written by Alan Paton, exploring themes of racial separation and its effects in South Africa."</data>
